sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Government Welfare Scheme Document Assistant - End-to-End Data Flow

    %% Actors & Services
    actor Admin as Scheme Administrator
    actor User as Citizen / Helpdesk Staff
    participant WebUI as Web Application (Frontend)
    participant APIGW as API Gateway / Ingress
    participant CoreAPI as Core API Service
    participant ObjStore as Object Storage (S3/MinIO)
    participant Queue as Task Broker (Redis/RabbitMQ)
    participant Worker as Background Ingestion Worker
    participant EmbedAPI as Embedding Model Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (pgvector + Relational)
    participant SearchEngine as Hybrid Retrieval & Reranker
    participant LLM as LLM Inference Gateway
    participant Guard as Citation & Grounding Validator
    participant Audit as Audit Logging Service

    %% ==========================================
    %% FLOW A: DOCUMENT INGESTION & INDEXING FLOW
    %% ==========================================
    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    note over Admin, DB: Flow A: Official Document Upload, Parsing, Embedding & Indexing
    Admin->>WebUI: Uploads official scheme PDF + Enters metadata (Dept, Scheme, Effective Date)
    WebUI->>APIGW: POST /api/v1/documents/upload (Multipart with JWT)
    APIGW->>CoreAPI: Validate Admin RBAC & File Checksum (SHA-256)
    CoreAPI->>ObjStore: Store original PDF at raw/{collection_id}/{doc_id}/{version_id}/original.pdf
    CoreAPI->>DB: Insert record into DOCUMENTS & DOCUMENT_VERSIONS (Status: QUEUED)
    CoreAPI->>Queue: Publish Ingestion Task Payload (version_id, storage_path)
    CoreAPI-->>WebUI: 202 Accepted (Tracking ID returned)

    Queue->>Worker: Consume Ingestion Task
    Worker->>DB: Update DOCUMENT_VERSIONS (Status: PROCESSING)
    Worker->>ObjStore: Fetch original PDF
    Worker->>Worker: Virus scan, PDF structure validation & page splitting
    Worker->>ObjStore: Save page preview images & layout JSON at processed/{version_id}/pages/
    Worker->>Worker: Hierarchical chunking (Preserve exact Page Number, Header Hierarchy, & Text Offsets)
    
    loop For each page & chunk batch
        Worker->>EmbedAPI: Generate dense vector embeddings (e.g. 768-dim)
        EmbedAPI-->>Worker: Return embedding vectors
        Worker->>Worker: Compute tsvector lexical tokens for keyword search
        Worker->>DB: Batch insert DOCUMENT_PAGES & DOCUMENT_CHUNKS (embeddings, tsv, metadata)
    end
    
    Worker->>DB: Update DOCUMENT_VERSIONS (Status: ACTIVE) & Update current_version
    Worker->>Audit: Log DOCUMENT_INGESTION_COMPLETED event
    Audit->>DB: Insert into AUDIT_LOGS
    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% FLOW B: USER QUERY, RETRIEVAL & CITATION FLOW
    %% ==========================================
    rect rgb(245, 255, 240)
    note over User, Audit: Flow B: Scoped Query, Hybrid Retrieval, Grounded Generation & Citation Validation
    User->>WebUI: Selects Scheme Collection & Enters Question
    WebUI->>APIGW: POST /api/v1/query (Question, Collection IDs, Department Filters)
    APIGW->>CoreAPI: Route Query & Apply Scope Filters
    CoreAPI->>SearchEngine: Execute Hybrid Retrieval (Vector + Keyword BM25)
    
    SearchEngine->>EmbedAPI: Generate Query Embedding
    EmbedAPI-->>SearchEngine: Query Vector
    
    SearchEngine->>DB: Execute Dense Vector Search (HNSW Cosine) + Sparse Keyword Search (GIN tsvector)
    DB-->>SearchEngine: Return Candidate Chunks scoped to Collection & Active Versions
    SearchEngine->>SearchEngine: Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF) & Cross-Encoder Reranking
    SearchEngine-->>CoreAPI: Top-5 Most Relevant Grounded Chunks with Page Metadata

    alt Top Retrieval Similarity Score < Confidence Threshold
        CoreAPI->>Audit: Log Query Refusal (Status: NOT_FOUND_IN_CORPUS)
        Audit->>DB: Insert into QUERY_LOGS
        CoreAPI-->>WebUI: Return deterministic "Information not found in uploaded official documents"
        WebUI-->>User: Display Not Found Notification & Support Helpline
    else High-Confidence Context Found
        CoreAPI->>LLM: Send Grounded Prompt (Context Chunks + Question + Strict Citation Instruction)
        LLM-->>CoreAPI: Return Candidate Structured Answer with [Doc Name, Page X]
        
        CoreAPI->>Guard: Validate Inline Citations & Factual Faithfulness
        Guard->>Guard: Verify every citation matches retrieved chunk ID & page number
        
        alt Validation Passed
            Guard-->>CoreAPI: Verified Response Payload
            CoreAPI->>Audit: Log Successful Query & Served Citations (Sanitized PII)
            Audit->>DB: Insert into QUERY_LOGS & QUERY_CITATIONS
            CoreAPI-->>WebUI: 200 OK (Structured Answer + Interactive Citation Badges + Legal Disclaimer)
            WebUI-->>User: Render Structured Answer with Clickable Citations & Non-Guarantee Banner
        else Hallucinated Citation or Faithfulness Check Failed
            Guard-->>CoreAPI: Validation Flag: Mismatch Detected
            CoreAPI->>Audit: Log Grounding Anomaly (Status: VALIDATION_FAILED)
            Audit->>DB: Insert into AUDIT_LOGS
            CoreAPI-->>WebUI: Return Fallback "Information could not be verified in official text"
            WebUI-->>User: Display Refusal & Recommend Admin Review
        end
    end
    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% FLOW C: CITATION PREVIEW & FEEDBACK
    %% ==========================================
    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
    note over User, DB: Flow C: Citation Source Excerpt Preview & Feedback Loop
    User->>WebUI: Clicks Citation Badge (e.g. "[PM_Kisan_Guidelines_2024.pdf, Page 4]")
    WebUI->>CoreAPI: GET /api/v1/documents/pages/preview (doc_id, page_number)
    CoreAPI->>ObjStore: Generate Pre-Signed URL for processed/{version_id}/pages/page_4.png
    CoreAPI-->>WebUI: Return Pre-Signed URL & Highlight Offset
    WebUI-->>User: Open Modal displaying exact source PDF page with highlighted clause

    User->>WebUI: Submits Feedback (Helpful / Not Helpful + Tags)
    WebUI->>CoreAPI: POST /api/v1/feedback (query_id, is_helpful, comments)
    CoreAPI->>DB: Insert into QUERY_FEEDBACK
    end
